GOOGLE_SHEET_ID=1IqXL30M0O23dkaQaP85iLRHuUH7IMxGEUs-cJyzEbkQ

# Option 1 (Recommended for direct Google Sheet writes without user login):
# Paste the full JSON string of a Google Cloud Service Account key and share the sheet with its client_email as Editor.
